'''Volkner''' (Japanese: '''デンジ''' ''Denzi'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Choose 1 of your {{TCGP|Electivire}} or {{TCGP|Luxray}}. Attach 2 {{e|lightning}} Energy from your discard pile to that Pokémon.
}}

