==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Volkner}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Volkner]] is the [[Gym Leader]] of the [[Sunyshore Gym]].
*[[Luxray]] is a Pokémon that Volkner uses in Pokémon {{3v2|Diamond|Pearl|Platinum}}, {{2v2|Black|White|2}} and {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.
*[[Electivire]] is a Pokémon that Volkner uses in Pokémon {{pkmn|Platinum}}, {{2v2|Black|White|2}} and {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

